# Prettier before push

Before any `git push`, run `npx prettier . --check` (or `npm run format:check`).

If it fails:

1. Run `npx prettier . --write`
2. Commit the formatting changes
3. Re-run `npx prettier . --check`
4. Only then push

Do not skip this for "push everything" or similar. The GitHub `prettier.yml` workflow runs the same check on `main`.
